WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.873
Walking through the woods, Alice noticed a tree with a door in its trunk.

2
00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.890
"That's strange!" she said.

3
00:00:10.891 --> 00:00:13.226
"But everything's strange today.

4
00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:23.819
I might as well go through the door."

5
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:28.804
Alice soon found herself in the hall with the glass table.

6
00:00:28.805 --> 00:00:31.391
"Oh, I'm back here again!

7
00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:40.292
Let's see if I can do things in the right order this time."

8
00:00:40.293 --> 00:00:44.907
First, Alice used the gold key to unlock the garden door.

9
00:00:44.908 --> 00:00:48.948
Then, she took a piece of mushroom from her pocket.

10
00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:53.568
She nibbled it until she was a foot high.

11
00:00:53.569 --> 00:01:02.540
Finally, she walked through the door and into the beautiful garden.

12
00:01:02.541 --> 00:01:05.917
A large rosebush stood near the entrance.

13
00:01:05.918 --> 00:01:11.434
Its flowers were white, but three gardeners were busy painting them red.

14
00:01:11.435 --> 00:01:15.599
The gardeners wore outfits that looked like playing cards.

15
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:22.732
Alice noticed that they were the two, five, and seven of spades.

16
00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:29.700
"Be careful, Five!" Two said. "You're splashing paint on me."

17
00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:36.220
"I couldn't help it," Five said. "Seven bumped my elbow."

18
00:01:36.221 --> 00:01:43.422
Seven scowled. "You're always blaming everyone else, Five! You should—"

19
00:01:43.423 --> 00:01:49.035
Spotting Alice, Seven bowed low, as did the other cards.

20
00:01:49.036 --> 00:01:51.930
Alice suddenly felt a bit shy.

21
00:01:51.931 --> 00:01:56.033
"Would you please tell me why you're painting those roses?"

22
00:01:56.034 --> 00:02:03.051
Two spoke up. "Well, you see, miss, the Queen wanted a red rosebush.

23
00:02:03.052 --> 00:02:09.469
We planted a white one by mistake, and if she found out—"

24
00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:13.437
"She'd cut off our heads!" Seven said.

25
00:02:13.438 --> 00:02:16.699
Five was looking anxiously around the garden.

26
00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:21.508
"The Queen! The Queen!" he shouted.

27
00:02:21.509 --> 00:02:27.112
All three cards instantly threw themselves on the ground, facedown.

28
00:02:27.113 --> 00:02:30.162
Alice looked up to see a parade.

29
00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:32.941
First came ten soldiers.

30
00:02:32.942 --> 00:02:39.466
Their outfits were shaped like playing cards too, but they had clubs instead of spades.

31
00:02:39.467 --> 00:02:45.158
Next came ten royal children, whose outfits had hearts.

32
00:02:45.159 --> 00:02:51.253
After that came some others.

33
00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:55.501
"There's the White Rabbit!" Alice said.

34
00:02:55.502 --> 00:03:01.207
He seemed quite nervous and didn't notice her as he passed.

35
00:03:01.208 --> 00:03:07.680
Then came the Knave of Hearts, followed by his parents, the King and Queen of Hearts.

36
00:03:07.681 --> 00:03:11.804
When the King and Queen reached Alice, they stopped.

37
00:03:11.805 --> 00:03:17.149
Everyone else stopped too, turning to stare at her.

38
00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:21.919
"Who are you?" the Queen demanded.

39
00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:26.539
"My name is Alice," she said aloud in a polite voice.

40
00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:30.760
But to herself she said, "They're only a pack of cards!

41
00:03:30.761 --> 00:03:34.528
There's no need to be afraid of them."

42
00:03:34.529 --> 00:03:37.538
The Queen noticed the three gardeners.

43
00:03:37.539 --> 00:03:42.061
Their backs matched those of her soldiers and her children.

44
00:03:42.062 --> 00:03:45.587
"And who are these people?"

45
00:03:45.588 --> 00:03:50.313
"How should I know?" Alice said, surprised at her own courage.

46
00:03:50.314 --> 00:03:56.396
Turning bright red, the Queen screamed, "Off with her head!"

47
00:03:56.397 --> 00:04:00.162
"Nonsense!" Alice said loudly.

48
00:04:00.163 --> 00:04:04.671
The Queen went silent, but she still looked angry.

49
00:04:04.672 --> 00:04:07.485
The King put his hand on the Queen's arm.

50
00:04:07.486 --> 00:04:13.779
"She's only a child," he said.

51
00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:17.876
"Get up!" the Queen screamed at the gardeners.

52
00:04:17.877 --> 00:04:23.860
The three gardeners popped up and began bowing to everyone at once.

53
00:04:23.861 --> 00:04:32.000
"Stop that! You're making me dizzy!" the Queen shouted.

54
00:04:32.001 --> 00:04:37.835
She pointed to the rosebush. "What's going on here?"

55
00:04:37.836 --> 00:04:41.022
"We're trying . . . ," Two began.

56
00:04:41.023 --> 00:04:52.896
"I can see that! Off with their heads!" the Queen shouted, and the parade began to move again.

57
00:04:52.897 --> 00:04:57.834
Terrified, the gardeners ran to Alice for protection.

58
00:04:57.835 --> 00:05:01.799
"I won't let the soldiers hurt you," she said.

59
00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:09.921
Alice quickly hid them in a flowerpot while the soldiers searched high and low.

60
00:05:09.922 --> 00:05:15.701
"Are their heads off?" the Queen shouted back at the soldiers.

61
00:05:15.702 --> 00:05:20.833
"Of course, Your Majesty," the soldiers replied.

62
00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:25.332
Giving up their search, they joined the end of the parade.

63
00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:28.733
The Queen shouted over her shoulder to Alice.

64
00:05:28.734 --> 00:05:32.406
"Can you play croquet?"

65
00:05:32.407 --> 00:05:36.688
Alice was surprised, but she replied, "Yes."

66
00:05:36.689 --> 00:05:44.600
"Then come with us," the Queen called, and Alice joined the parade.

